# PONS $101 — EDUCATION CURRICULUM & MARKET LAB CATALOG

PONS $101 is the educational front door of the ROB Lab.

The course teaches students, researchers, builders, and AI agents how to understand token-launch infrastructure before participating in a live experiment.

The educational objective is not:

HOW TO MAKE A TOKEN PUMP.

The objective is:

HOW TO UNDERSTAND, DOCUMENT, TEST, AND REPRODUCE A TOKEN-LAUNCH SYSTEM.

PONS $101 connects:

FINANCIAL-MARKET LITERACY

TOKEN-LAUNCH MECHANICS

ROBINHOOD CHAIN

PONS V2

SMART CONTRACTS

BONDING CURVES

FEES

AUTOMATED MARKET ACTIVITY

AI AGENTS

MIXED-METHODS RESEARCH

PROVENANCE

402 GOVERNANCE

PUBLIC-GOOD ACCOUNTING

and

HUMAN AUTHORITY.

The governing educational question is:

WHAT DID WE KNOW BEFORE THE OUTCOME?

